  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">연금공단에서 우편물이 왔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B9DC3C5B289C581F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"2.png\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"567\"  id=\"A_99B9DC3C5B289C581F090B\"/></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990B4F3D5B289C690A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"567\"  id=\"A_990B4F3D5B289C690A9773\"/></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;이걸 받고 처음에는 기뻤습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 더 이상 봉급에서 연금이 빠져 나가지 않으니까요. <span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그런데 시간이 흐를수록 생각이 많아집니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지금도 과학실에서 아이들을 맞이하는 일상이 행복한데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주관식인 생각 때문에</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) 노인네</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(?)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가 학교에서 버티고 있는 상황이 민폐가 되면 어쩌나</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">하고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;처음 교단에 서던 날 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">33</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년씩이나</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(?) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학교에 있게 되리라 짐작하지 못하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이렇듯 시간은 기어코 흐릅니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아래는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">응답하라 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1988</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">』 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">마지막 회 대사를 인용한 글입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다시 돌아갈 수 없는 건 내 청춘도 그 당시의 학교도 마찬가지였다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,san